    "Runtime deserialization boundary precheck keeps direct deserializeCudaEngineV2/loadRuntime deferred until plugin/library dependency diagnostics and package-consumer runtime proof exist.",
    "Runtime deserialization dependency diagnostics distinguish dependency-probe-only and blocked-by-cuda-driver; they do not promote runtime proof.",
